 |            │ demo                                                                                         │
R|            │   q             app.quit                                   Exit the application              │
 |            │   r             demo.reset                                 Rebuild the story from its file   │
 |            │   enter         demo.open                                  Open the row: attach the fake     │
 |            │                                                            pane when the story has one for   │
 |            │                                                            it                                │
 |            │   n             demo.notify                                Add a persistent notice naming    │
 |            │                                                            the row                           │
 |            │   x             demo.delete                                Remove the row from its list      │
 |            │ ▾ z                                                        waits for the next key (2 keys)   │
 |            │   ▸ z h         demo.reset                                 Rebuild the story from its file   │
 |            │   ▸ z l         demo.open                                  Open the row: attach the fake     │
 |            │                                                            pane when the story has one for   │
 |            │                                                            it                                │
 |            │   ▸ z esc       mode.leave                                 Return from a pending mode to the │
 |            │                                                            mode it shadowed                  │
 |            │ ▾ ctrl+a                                                   waits for the next key (4 keys)   │
 |            │   ▸ ctrl+a n    demo.reset                                 Rebuild the story from its file   │
 |            │   ▸ ctrl+a N    demo.open                                  Open the row: attach the fake     │
 |            │                                                            pane when the story has one for   │
 |            │                                                            it                                │
 |            │   ▸ ctrl+a t    demo.delete                                Remove the row from its list      │
 |            │   ▸ ctrl+a v    demo.notify                                Add a persistent notice naming    │
 |            │                                                            the row                           │
 |            │   ▸ ctrl+a esc  mode.leave                                 Return from a pending mode to the │
 |            │                                                            mode it shadowed                  │
 |            │ ▾ g                                                        waits for the next key (2 keys)   │
 |            │   ▾ g c                                                    waits for the next key (2 keys)   │
 |            │     ▸ g c x     demo.notify                                Add a persistent notice naming    │
 |            │                                                            the row                           │
 |            │     ▸ g c y     notice.clear                               Clear the persistent notices from │
 |            │                                                            the footer                        │
 |            │     ▸ g c esc   mode.leave                                 Return from a pending mode to the │
 |            │                                                            mode it shadowed                  │
 |            │   ▸ g esc       mode.leave                                 Return from a pending mode to the │
 |            │                                                            mode it shadowed                  │
 |            │ list                                                                                         │
 |            │   space         list.mark                                  Toggle the mark on a row (the     │
 |            │                                                            selected row by default) for fan- │
 |            │                                                            out verbs                         │
 |            │   V             list.visual                                Start a visual row selection at   │
 |            │                                                            the selected row (V, in visual-   │
 |            │                                                            line), or end it (V again, esc):  │
 |            │                                                            j/k extend it; a key then acts on │
 |            │                                                            every selected row                │
 |            │ app                                                                                          │
 |            │   ctrl+c        app.quit                                   Exit the application              │
 |            │   "             mode.enter          mode register_pending  Pick the register the next yank,  │
 |            │                                                            delete or paste uses ("a)         │
 |            │   @             mode.enter          count 1                Replay the macro in the register  │
 |            │                                     mode  replay_pending   typed next (@a), count times      │
 |            │   1-9           mode.enter          count $digit           Start a count for the next key    │
 |            │                                     mode  count_pending    (3j)                              │
